# Existing .pert plans should normally be maintained through perttool commands; direct DSL editing bypasses goal/DAG owner-confirmation checks.
project PROJECT_ACTUALS:
  version 1
  title "Project actuals and Git-recorded history"
  description "Design and implement explicit task work events, lifecycle transitions, read-only Git reconstruction, and exact observed project performance as an independent post-beta workstream. ACTUALS_CONTRACT_REVIEW accepted ADR 0006, Grammar 5 source and migration, Graph semantics 2, Mutation semantics 2, CLI Contract 6 schemas, diagnostics, and fourteen machine-readable PACT cases; Git commit f6e93e1 records its completed 4p pre-advance snapshot. ACTUAL_SOURCE_CORE accepted identity-checked internal Grammar 5 parsing, validation, formatting, exact task-owned event projection, and active Grammar 1-4 compatibility; Git commit d6d3d7f records its completed 5p pre-advance snapshot, and the task is advanced to reached ACTUAL_SOURCE_READY. ACTUAL_GIT_HISTORY_PROBE accepted the internal read-only SHA-1/SHA-256 repository/path/revision probe, first-parent raw snapshots, typed availability, linked worktrees, race detection, and unchanged Git/public surfaces; Git commit 2198a0b records its completed 5p pre-advance snapshot, and the task and satisfied source/history gates are advanced to reached HISTORY_INPUT_READY. FINISH_ACTUALS accepted deterministic eventful finish, exact active-time and effort inputs, finish-only and complete coverage, retry/conflict handling, governed Grammar 5 safe write, task-owned advance removal, and unchanged active Grammar 1-4 and CLI Contract 5; Git commit 2af13c4 records its exact completed 5p pre-advance snapshot, and the task is advanced to reached FINISH_ACTUALS_READY. PROJECT_HISTORY accepted internal first-parent semantic reduction, declared-event deduplication and advance removal, qualified legacy Git-recorded transitions, exact task summaries, typed incomplete/unavailable outcomes, deterministic ProjectHistoryResult v1 JSON/text, and unchanged active public surfaces; Git commit c0eff39 records its exact completed 6p pre-advance snapshot, and the task is advanced to reached PROJECT_HISTORY_READY. WORK_LIFECYCLE accepted exact start, suspend, and resume candidates, deterministic retry and refusal, suspended resource release, full remaining-duration schedules, and separate AnalysisResult v4/NextResult v5 target handling without changing active public surfaces; Git commit 518a59e records its exact completed 7p pre-advance snapshot, and the task is advanced to reached LIFECYCLE_READY. VELOCITY_OBSERVATION accepted exact elapsed-hour, qualified active-date, effort-productivity, and separately qualified Git-recorded rates, deterministic selection and provenance, and unchanged declared velocity/public surfaces; the completed task is retained as done pending its required pre-advance commit. Two tasks and 10p remain. Precedence and the parallel-sgs version 1 heuristic resource makespan are both 10p with no resource delay; both forecasts at 29p/2d are 20/29d. Complete NextResult v4 recommends and starts only ACTUALS_PUBLIC_CONTRACT. Grammar 5 and CLI Contract 6 remain publicly inactive, and this plan does not authorize Git mutation, automatic declared-velocity changes, MIG-08, release publication, or dist-tag movement."
  as_of 2026-07-28
  duration_unit point
  velocity 29p/2d
  finish ACTUALS_ACCEPTED


resource DEVELOPERS:
  title "Implementation capacity"
  description "Two implementation slices may run concurrently when their owned surfaces do not overlap"
  capacity 2

resource REVIEWERS:
  title "Normative and public-contract review capacity"
  description "Only one cross-cutting contract or acceptance review runs at a time"
  capacity 1

resource NORMATIVE_SURFACE:
  title "Requirements, specifications, ADR, and normative examples"
  capacity 1

resource SOURCE_SURFACE:
  title "Grammar, parser, semantic, formatter, and mutation ownership"
  capacity 1

resource GIT_SURFACE:
  title "Read-only Git adapter and history reconstruction ownership"
  capacity 1

resource CLI_SURFACE:
  title "Command registry, help, diagnostics, and public result ownership"
  capacity 1

resource WRITE_PATH:
  title "Governed mutation, advance, and safe-write ownership"
  capacity 1

resource PACKAGE_SURFACE:
  title "Package root and installed-workflow acceptance ownership"
  capacity 1





milestone LIFECYCLE_READY:
  title "Work lifecycle Core ready"
  state reached


milestone PROJECT_HISTORY_READY:
  title "Project history interface ready"
  state reached

milestone VELOCITY_OBSERVATION_READY:
  title "Observed project performance ready"

milestone ACTUALS_INTEGRATED_INPUT:
  title "Lifecycle and observation inputs integrated"

milestone ACTUALS_PUBLIC_READY:
  title "Grammar 5 and CLI Contract 6 public surface ready"

milestone ACTUALS_ACCEPTED:
  title "Project actuals and Git history accepted"









task VELOCITY_OBSERVATION PROJECT_HISTORY_READY -> VELOCITY_OBSERVATION_READY:
  title "Implement exact velocity and effort observations"
  description "Derive completed baseline Points, exact elapsed-hour throughput, qualified active-date throughput, and Point/person-hour productivity with explicit sample provenance and coverage. Do not double-count parallel cycle time, infer day/hour or effort, read the clock, or mutate declared velocity."
  duration 5p
  status done
  priority 90
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    GIT_SURFACE 1

gate LIFECYCLE_INTEGRATION_GATE LIFECYCLE_READY -> ACTUALS_INTEGRATED_INPUT:
  reason "Public activation requires complete lifecycle behavior"

gate OBSERVATION_INTEGRATION_GATE VELOCITY_OBSERVATION_READY -> ACTUALS_INTEGRATED_INPUT:
  reason "Public activation requires history-derived observations"

task ACTUALS_PUBLIC_CONTRACT ACTUALS_INTEGRATED_INPUT -> ACTUALS_PUBLIC_READY:
  title "Activate Grammar 5 and CLI Contract 6 atomically"
  description "Activate parser, formatter, lifecycle mutations, suspended graph/results, project history, velocity observation, root exports, command registry, text/JSON help, Guide, schemas, diagnostics, examples, and migration guidance in one compatibility-reviewed cutover."
  duration 6p
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    NORMATIVE_SURFACE 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
    PACKAGE_SURFACE 1

task ACTUALS_ACCEPTANCE ACTUALS_PUBLIC_READY -> ACTUALS_ACCEPTED:
  title "Accept project actuals and Git-recorded history"
  description "Trace every PACT case through requirements, source, lifecycle, advance, real Git histories, Core, CLI, schemas, help, package root, link, and installed workflow. Prove deterministic qualification, no automatic Git or velocity mutation, retained Contract 5 compatibility, and no release side effect."
  duration 4p
  priority 100
  requires:
    DEVELOPERS 1
    REVIEWERS 1
    GIT_SURFACE 1
    CLI_SURFACE 1
    PACKAGE_SURFACE 1
